# What the image build (docker/Dockerfile) leaves out of its context: history, local builds and
# installs, secrets, and what the web build does not read. BuildKit reads this file in place of a
# .dockerignore at the root of the context because it sits beside the Dockerfile and has its name.
.git
.env
.env.*
node_modules
dist
docs
e2e
ios
android
test-results
playwright-report
.baspowers
*.log
